  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Project: Ankara EGO Route and Operation Optimization, through Core Compete Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is funding Technical Assistance (TA) to provide support to the Ankara Electricity, Gas and Bus Operations Organization (EGO) in its implementation of a bus route and operation optimization project. The TA will introduce an artificial intelligence (AI) based software platform to improve bus route planning and optimization in Ankara, Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
